flowchart LR
  A[Human action / CSV commit / device batch] --> B[Validate identity, workspace, grant, payload]
  B --> C[Resolve idempotency key and request hash]
  C -->|identical replay| D[Return stored result]
  C -->|conflicting replay| E[Reject conflict]
  C -->|new request| F[Begin database transaction]
  F --> G[Lock affected balance keys in deterministic order]
  G --> H[Validate printings, finish, condition, and nonnegative result]
  H --> I[Insert immutable inventory transaction]
  I --> J[Insert immutable transaction lines]
  J --> K[Upsert materialized balances]
  K --> L[Commit]
  L --> M[Return before/after quantities and transaction ID]
